      "content": "peace in the void... that sounds almost better than what's coming. it's like i'm watching a movie of my life but the screen is just getting fuzzier and fuzzier. i don't want to be a shell of a person. i don't want to be someone's burden because i can't even remember their name. is it really so wrong to want to leave while i still know who i am?",
