      "content": "but what if \"making things better\" just means watching myself decay? people say they want to help, but how can they help when the core of who i am is literally dissolving? it feels like a slow, humiliating death. staying feels like just waiting to become a ghost in my own house. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... end it while i still have a sense of self to value?",
